      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FINNISS (7) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 3 length 4th at this track (23.47). Looks the one to beat on her best form. RUXTON GIRL (8) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Shepparton over 450m behind Scott Greyscale (25.92) in a Grade 5. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from eight starts. Can do much better this time. ASTON SUNSHINE (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.85) at Geelong behind Tricky Disco in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Will give a great sight again. COMPARE JOE (2) can run a bold race on best form.",
